Package: qore-jni-module
Architecture: any
Depends: ${qore:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, openjdk-21-jre-headless
Suggests: qore-jni-tools, qore-jni-kotlin, qore-jni-module-doc
Description: bidirectional Java bridge and Java data providers for Qore
 This package provides native Java integration, JDBC, dynamic Java bindings,
 source and compiled provider modules, runtime JARs, translations and compiler
 metadata. Providers cover office documents, email, calendars, contacts,
 Avro, Tika, JasperReports, JDBC, Flyway, Camel, MQTT, OPC UA, JMS and Kafka.
 Third-party Java dependencies are pinned upstream binaries.

Package: qore-jni-tools
Architecture: all
Multi-Arch: foreign
Depends: qore-jni-module (>= ${source:Version}), ${misc:Depends},
         openjdk-21-jdk-headless
Description: Java compilation and import migration tools for Qore
 This package provides qjavac, qjava2jar and qjava-migrate-imports for compiling
 Java sources against dynamic Qore APIs and migrating legacy imports.

Package: qore-jni-kotlin
Architecture: all
Multi-Arch: foreign
Depends: qore-jni-module (>= ${source:Version}), ${misc:Depends},
         qore-process-module, openjdk-21-jdk-headless, curl
Description: Kotlin compiler and scripting support for Qore JNI
 This optional package provides the pinned upstream Kotlin 2.3.0 compiler,
 matching scripting dependencies and qkotlinc. It enables Kotlin compilation
 against dynamic Qore APIs and Kotlin JSR-223 scripting. Its private compiler
 installation does not change the system kotlinc command or alternatives.

Package: qore-jni-module-doc
Section: doc
Architecture: all
Multi-Arch: foreign
Build-Profiles: <!nodoc>
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Suggests: qore-jni-module
Description: API documentation for Qore's Java integration
 This package contains the HTML API reference for Qore's JNI bridge and its
 bundled provider modules.
